      "content": "\"the next version of me\"?? what is there left to discover? everyone i know looks at me with pity or just pure disgust. the person i was... he's dead. i can't go back to being that person, and i don't see the point in trying to become someone else when everything is already ruined. it's just... it's just empty.",
